.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_BMAP 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_bmap
.Nd map logical vnode offsets to physical blocks
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_bmap "struct vnode *vp" "off_t offset" "struct vnode **vpp" "uint64_t *bnp" "int *runp" "int *runb"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn vop_bmap
translates a vnode logical offset into a physical block number and optional
forward/backward run lengths for read-ahead clustering.
If the vnode does not provide a filesystem-specific mapper, a direct fallback
mapping is returned.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 0 on success, or an error number.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width "[EOPNOTSUPP]"
.It Bq Er EINVAL
.Fa bnp
is NULL.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_strategy 9
